\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Can I help you with anything? I can drop by the store tomorrow."}, {"time": "14000", "image": "engenn6le16ob03re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That would be great, thanks. We need a dozen slices of bacon, a jar of pickles and a couple of tins of capers. You should also get a few dozen buns.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What's all that for? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'll prepare a tray of hors d'oeuvres. I'm going to make pulled pork for the main course."}, {"time": "30000", "image": "engenn6le16ob03re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That sounds great! It's quite time-consuming, though!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I know. That's why I'm preparing it tonight! It needs to sit in the slow cooker for a while. When the meat is tender, it will literally fall off the bone! Low temperature cooking is the key to this recipe!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: This sounds like the best meal ever! All we need is a couple of pints of beer to wash it down!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Let's also get a gallon of juice!"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa and Sally Plan a Party"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The Best Meal"}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 16}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify and describe personal and regional eating habits and cooking in a range of communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking About Future Actions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use four different tenses to talk about the future. Each of these tenses has a different function."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use <span class=\"italic\">will</span> for predictions and forecasts, for spontaneous decisions, and for offers and promises."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use <span class=\"italic\">going to</span> for intentions, previously made decisions, or something that is very likely to happen."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the <span class=\"italic\">Present Continuous</span> for arrangements and plans."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the <span class=\"italic\">Present Simple</span>  for timetables, schedules and repeated events."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Simple</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I think she will win Wimbledon.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm going to read War and Peace this weekend.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We're getting married in Spain on the 24th.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">It's Christmas next week.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The weather will be perfect all week.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We are going to get married, but we don't know when.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm having coffee with my boss tomorrow.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I have a german class on Tuesday.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Yes, I will marry you!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Look at those clouds! It's going to rain.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm meeting my accountant tomorrow at 9 a.m.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">He has a job interview in two days.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'll help you plan the party.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Watch what you're doing! You're going to fall over.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">They are flying to Australia next Tuesday.</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'll see you tomorrow.</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"\",\"\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Quantifiers and Amounts"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<ul><li>You use quantifiers to talk about the quantity or amount of something.</li><li>Remember there are general and specific quantifies.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" General Quantifiers \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Specific Quantifiers\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Count Nouns\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"   All<br> Most<br> Many<br> Some<br> Any<br> A few<br> A lot of<br> A couple of<br> No\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"All of <br> Most of<br> Many of<br> Some of<br> Any of<br> A few of<br> A lot of (the ... )<br> A couple of (the \u2026 )<br> None of\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Non-Count Nouns\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"All<br> Some<br> Any<br> A little<br> Much<br> No\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"All of <br> Some of<br> Any of<br> A little<br> Much of\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":13,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Measurements (Nouns)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Amount\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" pound      \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" a little less than half a kilogram  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" pint\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a little less than half a liter\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"quart \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a little less than one liter\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"gallon\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"about three liters and a half\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"dozen\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"12 pieces\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"slice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a cut piece from a whole\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"case \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a box of 6, 12 or 24 bottles\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"cup\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a little less than \u00bc of a liter \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tin, jar, can\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"containers \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a pinch / a dash\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a very small amount\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" a teaspoon \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" a small measuring spoon \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a tablespoon\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a large measuring spoon\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "We need a dozen slices of bacon, a jar of pickles and a couple of tins of capers."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "jar "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a wide-mouthed cylindrical container made of glass "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to buy a jar of pickles."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob03aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about preparing food."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tin "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a metal container "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to get a couple of tins of capers."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob03aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "gallon "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a measuring unit for liquids equal to four quarts (3.5 liters) "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Let's buy a gallon of orange juice."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob03aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "slow cooker "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a large pot used for cooking food very slowly"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: The meat needs to sit in the slow cooker for a few hours."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob03aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bun  "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a bread roll used for sandwiches and hamburgers "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We should get a dozen buns to make sandwiches."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob03aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "low temperature "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a method of cooking slowly at low heat "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Low temperature cooking is the key to this recipe."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob03aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hors d'oeuvre "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "appetizers "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'll prepare a variety of hors d'oeuvres before the main course."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob03aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tray "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a large serving dish "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: I'll prepare a tray of hors d'oeuvres."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob03aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "literally "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "exactly; precisely; indeed "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The meat will literally fall off the bone!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le16ob03aud10"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le16ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go online and look for a cooking program, like Jamie Oliver or Curtis Stone."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Watch an episode of their program."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down the ingredients for the recipe. Remember the correct quantity and amounts!"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your recipe to your partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down your partner's recipe."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Talk about when you are going to prepare that recipe."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I describe how to prepare food."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use quantities and amounts."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about things I want to do in the future."}]}]}